Scope of this licence

This licence covers the original contributions of this project: the launcher
(port/src/launcher), the shared core library (port/src/core), the platform layer
(port/src/platform), the tools (tools/, port/src/tools) and the project's own
icon artwork (port/res, generated by tools/make_icon.py).

It does NOT cover:
